From: Nikhil Gurram <nikhgurr@qti.qualcomm.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pwhm: consolidate MLO link reconfiguration and cleanup

This preserves link-scoped MLO reconfiguration, primary-link promotion,
enabled-link restoration, empty-MLD cleanup, and logical hostapd anchor
removal while avoiding a fragmented patch series.

The changes remain scoped to the affected MLD and do not require restarting
other MLDs sharing the same radio.

Signed-off-by: Nikhil Gurram <nikhgurr@qti.qualcomm.com>
---

--- a/include/wld/wld_mld.h
+++ b/include/wld/wld_mld.h
@@ -178,6 +178,9 @@
     amxc_llist_t links;                                                    /* List of affiliated links belonging to this MLD */
     wld_mldGroup_t* pGroup;                                                /* Back pointer to parent group */
     wld_mldLink_t* pPrimLink;                                              /* Primary link for this MLD */
+    bool hostapdRemoved;                                                    /* Runtime MLD anchor was removed */
+    T_SSID* pHostapdAnchorSSID;                                             /* Original hostapd MLD anchor */
+    char hostapdAnchorIface[128];                                           /* Running hostapd MLD interface */
     wld_mldCfg_t Cfg;
     void* pExtCfg;                                                         /* extended mld configuration: defined per mld type */
     wld_tidLinkMapConfig_t tidLinkMapConfig;                               /**< TID-to-Link mapping configuration */
